     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRMedicationLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRMedicationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRMedicationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMMedication</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-produit-de-sante.html\">CDA - FR Produit de santeversion : 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ManufacturedProduct (FRCDAProduitDeSante)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.identifyingCode[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ManufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.code</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.classification</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ManufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.asSpecializedKind (Classification du produit)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.productName</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ManufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.name (Nom de marque du produit)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.marketingAuthorisationHolder</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.doseForm</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ManufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.formCode (Forme pharmaceutique)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.ingredient.isActive</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.ingredient.substance</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ManufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.ingredient.ingredient.code (Code de la substance)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.ingredient.strengthInfo.strength</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ManufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.ingredient.quantity (Dosage de l'ingrédient)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.ingredient.strengthInfo.basisOfStrengthSubstance</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.unitOfPresentation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ManufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.asContent.containerPackagedMedicine.formCode (Conditionnement)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.containedQuantity</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.amount</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ManufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.asContent.containerPackagedMedicine.capacityQuantity (Capacité du conditionnement primaire)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.packageType</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ManufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.asContent.containerPackagedMedicine (Conditionnement primaire)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.device</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.characteristic</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.batch.lotNumber</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ManufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.lotNumberText (Numéro de lot)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.batch.expirationDate</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ManufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.expirationTime (Date d'expiration du produit)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMMedication</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-fhir-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-medication-document.html\">Medication - FR Medication Documentversion : 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication (FRMedicationDocument)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.identifyingCode[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.code (Code du produit de santé)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.classification</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.extension:classification (Classification ATC.)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.productName</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.extension:productName (Nom de marque du produit.)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.marketingAuthorisationHolder</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.manufacturer (Manufacturer of the item)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.ingredient.item[x]:itemReference (The actual ingredient or content)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.doseForm</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.form (powder | tablets | capsule +)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.ingredient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.ingredient (Active or inactive ingredient)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.ingredient.isActive</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.ingredient.isActive (Active ingredient indicator)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.ingredient.substance</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.ingredient.item[x]:itemCodeableConcept (Code SMS de la substance active)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.ingredient.strengthInfo.strength</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.ingredient.strength (Quantité de substance présente dans le médicament)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.ingredient.strengthInfo.basisOfStrengthSubstance</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.ingredient.strength.extension:basisOfStrengthSubstance (Substance concernée.)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.unitOfPresentation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.extension:unitOfPresentation (Unité de présentation du produit de santé (comprimé, ampoule, tube). En général, le plus petit objet dénombrable du package.\nEDQM Standard Terms (0.4.0.127.0.16.1.1.2.1) / classe UOP (Unit of Presentation)..)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.containedQuantity</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.extension:sizeOfItem (Quantité de produit par unité (ex : 3 ml / 1 flacon).)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.amount</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.amount (Amount of drug in package)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.packageType</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.device</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.characteristic</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.extension:conditionnement (Présentation / conditionnement.)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.batch.lotNumber</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.batch.lotNumber (Numéro de lot)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.batch.expirationDate</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Medication.batch.expirationDate (Date d'expiration du produit)</td></tr></table></div>"
